fixture pogo_chain_window
doc BUILD.md s5 Pogo: "Chain window: Next down-strike can start on frame 6 after a bounce" (frame 14 was tried and reverted: docs/feel_log/2026-10-17-pogo-chain-window.md)
room test/spikes
spawn 1216 300
frames 50
input
  0..11 D
  12..13 D attack
  14..16 D
  # Held from bounce frame 4: the strike starts on frame 6.
  17..40 D attack
end
expect
  # The bounce frame counts as frame 1.
  at 14 event.pogo=1 since_bounce=1 action=none
  never 15..18 event.attack=1
  at 19 event.attack=1 action=down action_frame=1 since_bounce=6
  # The hold that began a down-strike never arms the Charged strike (movement review 6, H1).
  never 0..49 action=charged
  never 0..49 event.charge_release=1
end
